SH.asserts | Assert & ensure reporting | crash-diagnostics | E | \n833\t## XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n834\t # XC.DET Determinism & replay\n835\t   XC.DET.levels | Determinism levels & per-subsystem contract | determinism-replay | E | \n836\t   XC.DET.float | Floating-point determinism policy (flags, FMA, transcendentals) | determinism-replay | E | math-simd-numerics\n837\t   XC.DET.parallel | Deterministic parallel execution (ordered reductions) | determinism-replay | E | job-system-task-graph\n838\t   XC.DET.replay | Input & state record/replay for debugging | determinism-replay | E | \n839\t   XC.DET.desync | Desync detection & state hashing | determinism-replay | E | \n840\t   XC.DET.compat | Replay compatibility across builds | determinism-replay | E | api-lifecycle-migration\n841\t # XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration\n842\t   XC.ITER.protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n843\t   XC.ITER.live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n844\t   XC.ITER.coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n845\t   XC.ITER.metrics | Iteration-time metrics (edit → see latency) | hot-reload-iteration | E | developer-experience-docs\n846\t # XC.SEC Security\n847\t   XC.SEC.threats | Threat modeling | security-engineering | E | \n848\t   XC.SEC.coding | Secure coding & memory-safety policy | security-engineering | E | \n849\t   XC.SEC.trust | Trust boundaries for untrusted input | security-engineering | E | \n850\t   XC.SEC.supply-chain | Supply-chain security (SBOM, signing, reproducible builds) | security-engineering | E | build-system-toolchains\n851\t   XC.SEC.secrets | Secrets management | security-engineering | E | ci-cd-automation\n852\t   XC.SEC.tamper | Anti-tamper & DRM boundary | security-engineering | E | \n853\t   XC.SEC.privacy | Privacy engineering | security-engineering | E | \n854\t   XC.SEC.sandbox | Mod / UGC sandbox policy | security-engineering | E | modding-ugc\n855\t   XC.SEC.server-validation | Server-side cheat validation | anti-cheat-integrity | E | \n856\t   XC.SEC.anticheat | Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary | anti-cheat-integrity | E | \n857\t   XC.SEC.abuse | Exploit & economy-abuse detection signals | anti-cheat-integrity | E | platform-online-services\n858\t # XC.EXT Extensibility & evolution\n859\t   XC.EXT.api-surface | Public API surface definition | api-lifecycle-migration | E | \n860\t   XC.EXT.versioning | Semantic versioning & deprecation policy | api-lifecycle-migration | E | \n861\t   XC.EXT.abi | ABI policy for binary plugins | api-lifecycle-migration | E | plugin-system\n862\t   XC.EXT.upgrade | Engine upgrade tooling (codemods, data upgraders) | api-lifecycle-migration | E | serialization-schema\n863\t   XC.EXT.lts | LTS & support policy | api-lifecycle-migration | E | build-release-architect\n864\t   XC.EXT.plugins | Plugin architecture & discovery | plugin-system | E | \n865\t   XC.EXT.plugin-deps | Plugin packaging & dependency resolution | plugin-system | E | \n866\t   XC.EXT.mod-sdk | Mod SDK & tooling | modding-ugc | E | \n867\t   XC.EXT.mod-loading | Mod loading & override precedence | modding-ugc | E | package-formats-vfs\n868\t   XC.EXT.ugc | UGC pipeline | modding-ugc | E | platform-online-services\n869\t   XC.EXT.mod-compat | Mod compatibility across patches | modding-ugc | E | api-lifecycle-migration\n870\t # XC.DX Documentation & developer experience\n871\t   XC.DX.api-docs | API reference generation | developer-experience-docs | E | \n872\t   XC.DX.arch-docs | Architecture & subsystem documentation | developer-experience-docs | E | engine-architect\n873\t   XC.DX.samples | Sample-project ladder (2D → open-world online) doubling as integration tests | developer-experience-docs | E | \n874\t   XC.DX.templates | Project templates & creation | developer-experience-docs | E | \n875\t   XC.DX.onboarding | Onboarding paths | developer-experience-docs | E | \n876\t   XC.DX.doc-tests | Documentation testing (snippets compile and run) | developer-experience-docs | E | test-architect\n877\t   XC.DX.errors | Error-message & diagnostic quality standards | developer-experience-docs | E | \n878\t"}]},"uuid":"a16f8662-1cc3-403c-bd6b-7d6a9f08604d","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:47:24.203Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e3f83bb0-7381-49c3-bf55-0b7801caf66e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
