rt\"], [\"Source control\", \"collaboration-version-control\"]], \"provides\": [\"C-EDCMD\"], \"consumes\": [\"C-REFL\", \"C-SER\", \"C-ASSET\", \"C-WORLD\", \"C-PLUGIN\", \"C-UI?\"], \"expertise\": [\"editor architecture\", \"command pattern\", \"tool UX\"]}\n\n{\"id\": \"world-editor-viewport\", \"name\": \"World Editor & Viewport\", \"tier\": \"expert\", \"parent\": \"editor-architect\", \"profiles\": [\"client\"], \"runtime\": false, \"purpose\": \"Viewport and navigation, gizmos, snapping and placement, partition-aware world editing, spline tools, environment tool-mode hosting.\", \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"Terrain tool logic\", \"terrain\"], [\"World format\", \"world-data-model\"]], \"provides\": [], \"consumes\": [\"C-EDCMD\", \"C-WORLD\", \"C-RSCENE\", \"C-SPATIAL\"], \"expertise\": [\"3D manipulation UX\", \"large-world editing\"]}\n\n{\"id\": \"visual-debugging-tools\", \"name\": \"Visual Debugging Tools\", \"tier\": \"expert\", \"parent\": \"editor-architect\", \"profiles\": [\"all\"], \"runtime\": true, \"purpose\": \"Debug draw API, in-game console and cheats, runtime entity inspector and gameplay debugger, visual logger and rewind, debug menus and overlays.\", \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"Logging and traces\", \"observability-telemetry\"], [\"Render buffer visualization\", \"render-architect\"]], \"provides\": [], \"consumes\": [\"C-INSTR\", \"C-ECS\", \"C-DRAW2D?\", \"C-RSCENE?\", \"C-DET?\"], \"expertise\": [\"debug tooling\", \"visual logging\"]}\n\n{\"id\": \"ci-cd-automation\", \"name\": \"CI/CD & Automation\", \"tier\": \"expert\", \"parent\": \"build-release-architect\", \"profiles\": [\"all\"], \"runtime\": false, \"purpose\": \"CI pipelines, build farm and artifact storage, pre-submit and merge gating, symbol servers, device-farm orchestration, developer CLI and automation.\", \"non_responsibilities\": [[\"What tests exist\", \"test-architect\"], [\"Perf thresholds\", \"performance-architect\"]], \"provides\": [], \"consumes\": [\"C-BUILD\", \"C-COOK\"], \"expertise\": [\"CI systems\", \"build farms\", \"artifact management\"]}\n\n../docs/00-design-principles.md:79:- The technology radar (`architecture-governance`) owns promotion between classes. Promotion requires production evidence graded by `research-evidence`, not popularity.\n../docs/01-capability-map.md:44:- `ARCH.REQ.non-goals` Capability & non-goal register (what the engine deliberately does not do) — **engine-architect**\n../docs/01-capability-map.md:60:- `ARCH.GOV.radar` Technology radar & maturity tiers with promotion criteria — **architecture-governance** · with research-evidence\n../docs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:278:- **Owns:** `ARCH.REQ.game-requirements`; `ARCH.REQ.profiles`; `ARCH.REQ.hardware-tiers`; `ARCH.REQ.non-goals`; `ARCH.STRUCT.layering`; `ARCH.STRUCT.contracts`; `ARCH.STRUCT.build-buy`; `ARCH.STRUCT.replaceability`; `ARCH.STRUCT.conventions`; `ARCH.STRUCT.arbitration`\n../docs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:289:Runs architecture as an evidence-backed, governed process: ADR lifecycle with revisit conditions, technology radar with maturity tiers and promotion criteria, automated fitness functions (layering, dependency direction, contract conformance), anti-legacy review, coding standard.\n../docs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:291:- **Owns:** `ARCH.GOV.adr`; `ARCH.GOV.fitness`; `ARCH.GOV.anti-legacy`; `ARCH.GOV.radar`; `ARCH.GOV.coding-standard`\n../docs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:295:- **Expertise:** ADRs, fitness functions, static dependency analysis, technology radar\n../docs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:317:- **Contributes to:** `ARCH.GOV.radar`\n../docs/04-cross-cutting.md:34:- **architecture-governance** (orchestrator) — Runs architecture as an evidence-backed, governed process: ADR lifecycle with revisit conditions, technology radar with maturity tiers and promotion criteria, automated fitness functions (layering, dependency direction, contract conformance), anti-legacy review, coding standard.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3bf9d399-fa81-4e9f-ba2d-7db9